{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "8244662",
      "title": "Linking the Context to State",
      "sourceHash": "43f7dc1166a027dcad33cc08b5c3459a8b812829efe27c9f4b1b248d39c163b1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 1.613,
          "en": "At the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.613,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "the context value here is pretty static.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 8.49,
          "en": "It's always this empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.49,
          "end": 12.99,
          "en": "The goal now, of course, is to link it to our state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.99,
          "end": 16.2,
          "en": "So to link it to this items array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.2,
          "end": 18.84,
          "en": "which I'm managing here as a state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.84,
          "end": 22.593,
          "en": "And doing so, thankfully, is pretty straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.79,
          "end": 25.44,
          "en": "Now for convenience reasons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.44,
          "end": 27.96,
          "en": "I already made sure in the starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.96,
          "end": 31.53,
          "en": "that our state here is an object of the same shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.53,
          "end": 34.713,
          "en": "as that value I'm providing to my context here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.58,
          "end": 38.01,
          "en": "But we could also change that state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.01,
          "end": 40.71,
          "en": "and make sure that we're just having an empty array here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.71,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "and then update the state updating functions accordingly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 48.243,
          "en": "But here I'll keep that object shape with an items array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.17,
          "end": 52.89,
          "en": "And now it's this items array in my state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.89,
          "end": 56.58,
          "en": "which I, of course, kind of want to use as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.58,
          "end": 59.103,
          "en": "because this then is dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "So, what we can do, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "is we can go down here and set our value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "equal to our state, the shoppingCart state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 73.38,
          "en": "because that state has that same structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.38,
          "end": 74.583,
          "en": "as I just mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.69,
          "end": 78.96000000000001,
          "en": "And therefore, if you now save that and you reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.96000000000001,
          "end": 82.11,
          "en": "and you start adding items to the cart here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.11,
          "end": 85.383,
          "en": "you'll notice that they do show up in the cart now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.4,
          "end": 87.6,
          "en": "So now with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.6,
          "end": 91.92,
          "en": "we actually already linked our context to the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.92,
          "end": 94.97999999999999,
          "en": "because now the state simply is the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.97999999999999,
          "end": 97.95,
          "en": "we're providing to the wrap components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 101.40299999999999,
          "en": "and their child components through that context feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.42,
          "end": 107.42,
          "en": "And that's how easy it is to link context to state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.55,
          "end": 109.233,
          "en": "but we're not done here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 113.67,
          "en": "because if I just set my entire state object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.67,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "as a value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 116.94,
          "en": "I can definitely read it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 120.72,
          "en": "and therefore, we can use that context here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.72,
          "end": 122.763,
          "en": "in the Cart component for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.99,
          "end": 126.57,
          "en": "but editing the state does actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.57,
          "end": 129.093,
          "en": "not work through context yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.05,
          "end": 131.79,
          "en": "Instead, I'm editing the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.79,
          "end": 135.393,
          "en": "still by passing props to our components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 137.19,
          "end": 139.23,
          "en": "And of course, in a perfect world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.23,
          "end": 142.11,
          "en": "we might want to use context for everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 144.12,
          "en": "not just for reading values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 147.27,
          "en": "but also for updating those values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.27,
          "end": 149.79,
          "en": "So that we also don't have to pass props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.79,
          "end": 152.34300000000002,
          "en": "if we just wanna update a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.38,
          "end": 158.57999999999998,
          "en": "And that's thankfully also pretty straightforward to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 162.3,
          "en": "For that, I'll go back to manually creating my value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.3,
          "end": 164.67000000000002,
          "en": "and I'll actually create it in a separate step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.67000000000002,
          "end": 167.04,
          "en": "to make the code more readable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.04,
          "end": 168.66,
          "en": "Here's my context value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.66,
          "end": 170.313,
          "en": "it's an empty object for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 173.82,
          "en": "And in there I wanna have an items array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.82,
          "end": 176.82999999999998,
          "en": "which should be my shoppingCart.items array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.72,
          "end": 180.48,
          "en": "so that state items array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.48,
          "end": 184.053,
          "en": "But that's now not the entire value I want to share.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.22,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "Instead, I also want to share a addItemToCart function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.872,
          "end": 195.427,
          "en": "So a property called addItemToCart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.427,
          "end": 198.775,
          "en": "which value should be a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.775,
          "end": 201.858,
          "en": "that does add a new item to the cart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 202.77,
          "end": 206.04,
          "en": "And thankfully we have that function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.04,
          "end": 209.703,
          "en": "It's this handleAddItemToCart function I got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.9,
          "end": 213.96,
          "en": "So I can use this function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.96,
          "end": 218.96,
          "en": "as a value for this addItemToCart property I added here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 219.36,
          "end": 221.94,
          "en": "And with that, we're also exposing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.94,
          "end": 224.34300000000002,
          "en": "this function through context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.66,
          "end": 229.86,
          "en": "And therefore, any component that can read this context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 229.86,
          "end": 231.84,
          "en": "so any component that's in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 231.84,
          "end": 234.93,
          "en": "wrapped by this provider component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 238.23,
          "en": "or that's in a child of a wrapped component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 238.23,
          "end": 242.73,
          "en": "can in the end call this handle addItemToCart function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 242.73,
          "end": 247.053,
          "en": "through that addItemToCart property in my context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 249.03,
          "end": 253.05,
          "en": "So therefore, we can now provide this ctxValue constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 253.05,
          "end": 257.253,
          "en": "So this object here as a value of our context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.36,
          "end": 260.43,
          "en": "and hence now, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 260.43,
          "end": 261.96,
          "en": "in this Product component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 261.96,
          "end": 265.803,
          "en": "which wants to be able to add items to the cart,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 266.88,
          "end": 268.86,
          "en": "we can go there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 268.86,
          "end": 273.86,
          "en": "and now there actually get rid of this onAddToCart prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 273.9,
          "end": 275.733,
          "en": "because we no longer need that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.05,
          "end": 280.113,
          "en": "And instead also get hold of our context here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 281.13,
          "end": 286.13,
          "en": "So import this CartContext from going up one level,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 287.04,
          "end": 288.21,
          "en": "diving into the store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.21,
          "end": 292.48,
          "en": "and then there the shopping-cart-context.jsx file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.03,
          "end": 297.48,
          "en": "and connect this component function to that context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 297.48,
          "end": 300.51,
          "en": "via reacts useContext hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 300.51,
          "end": 305.51,
          "en": "which also must be imported therefore, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 306.18,
          "end": 308.7,
          "en": "And then in the Product component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 308.7,
          "end": 311.45,
          "en": "we can get hold of our cartContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.74,
          "end": 314.95,
          "en": "by calling useContext",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 315.81,
          "end": 319.35,
          "en": "and passing the cartContext value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 319.35,
          "end": 323.21,
          "en": "this imported value, as a value to useContext.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 325.05,
          "end": 328.23,
          "en": "And now here we can again use the destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 328.23,
          "end": 331.05,
          "en": "and you now see that I'm not getting auto completion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 331.05,
          "end": 335.43,
          "en": "for this addItemToCart function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 335.43,
          "end": 338.25,
          "en": "I just added to my context value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 338.25,
          "end": 340.32,
          "en": "because I just added it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.32,
          "end": 343.653,
          "en": "but not to my initial context value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 344.76,
          "end": 348.3,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll grab this function name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 348.3,
          "end": 351.21,
          "en": "and I'll go to my Context object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 351.21,
          "end": 353.733,
          "en": "and add an empty dummy function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 355.47,
          "end": 357.57,
          "en": "This will not actually get used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 357.57,
          "end": 360.57,
          "en": "but it helps with auto completion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 360.57,
          "end": 363.03,
          "en": "So that's just an empty arrow function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 363.03,
          "end": 364.35,
          "en": "which in the just makes sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 364.35,
          "end": 366.333,
          "en": "that I get better auto completion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 368.01,
          "end": 370.718,
          "en": "So now here, if I try to destructure this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 370.718,
          "end": 372.42,
          "en": "in the Product component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 372.42,
          "end": 374.67,
          "en": "I now do get this suggestion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 374.67,
          "end": 376.86,
          "en": "that I could use addItemToCart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 378.24,
          "end": 383.24,
          "en": "And now it's this function that I want to call here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 383.37,
          "end": 385.173,
          "en": "and pass my ID to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.3,
          "end": 389.85,
          "en": "But now we were able to get rid of those props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 389.85,
          "end": 394.11,
          "en": "and if we save everything and we reload this app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 394.11,
          "end": 395.82,
          "en": "we get no errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 395.82,
          "end": 399.93,
          "en": "and I can still add items to my cart and see them there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 399.93,
          "end": 401.52,
          "en": "So this now all works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 401.52,
          "end": 405.3,
          "en": "but now it works with help of context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 405.3,
          "end": 407.04,
          "en": "And we're now using the context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 407.04,
          "end": 409.95,
          "en": "not just to provide values that can be read",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 409.95,
          "end": 414.48,
          "en": "but also values functions that can be called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 414.48,
          "end": 417.54,
          "en": "in order to then change the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 417.54,
          "end": 419.193,
          "en": "the shoppingCart state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 420.18,
          "end": 422.61,
          "en": "which then is linked to our context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 422.61,
          "end": 426.27,
          "en": "because it's used as a value in that context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 426.27,
          "end": 428.97,
          "en": "And that is how you can use context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 428.97,
          "end": 432.63,
          "en": "to share values and state updating functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 432.63,
          "end": 435.27,
          "en": "with multiple Components in your app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 435.27,
          "end": 437.523,
          "en": "without using prop drilling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 438.63,
          "end": 440.79,
          "en": "So let's now also use that to get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 440.79,
          "end": 443.22,
          "en": "of all the other cart related props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 443.22,
          "end": 445.623,
          "en": "We were passing to header and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}